{
  "name": "dsh-websearch-local",
  "version": "0.5.0",
  "description": "免 API Key 的 dsh 联网搜索 / 网页抓取插件（引擎=逻辑源、入口=直连/镜像/加速回退）。v0.5.0：移除意图自动路由（引擎与参数由模型显式选择）；组合搜索并发上限 3 + 按需填充 + 到期返回已完成成员；429/503 与网络瞬时错误指数退避重试；web_fetch SSRF 防护；日志/错误令牌与代理凭据脱敏。本地修改版本。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "web-search",
    "web-fetch",
    "no-api-key"
  ],
  "license": "GPL-3.0-only",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "dist/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./dist/index.js",
    "./client": "./client/client.js"
  },
  "files": [
    "dist",
    "client",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "LICENSE",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "name": "websearch-local",
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": {
      "optional": true
    }
  }
}
